Independent Implementations:
1. Google AI Studio Gemini API provider without Google Cloud / Vertex AI dependencies.
2. Custom multi-metric evaluation harness replacing Google Cloud Evaluation Service.
3. OpenTelemetry and Jaeger local tracing integration with LLM-native token and cost metrics.
4. FastAPI backend and React TypeScript web dashboard.
5. Independent golden benchmark dataset and trajectory exact-match comparator.
